 <!-- Start Menu item: Tic-Tac-Toe 3D (from lg3d-incubator). A native 3D
 tic-tac-toe played against an unbeatable minimax opponent. Launched in-JVM
 via the "java <class>" command; the incubator jar is on the :lg3d-core:run
 classpath. Discovery only scans config/demo and config/incubator, so, following
 the Agenda 3D precedent, this descriptor lives in lg3d-apps/src/config
 (bundled to config/demo) rather than the incubator's own src/config. -->
